{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_014","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":2477,"char_end":2507,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_015","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"An NFTokenOffer entry represents an offer to buy, sell or transfer an NFT . You can create an NFT buy or sell offer by sending an NFTokenCreateOffer transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":2775,"char_end":2937,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_016","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Requires the NonFungibleTokensV1_1 amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 142","char_start":2939,"char_end":2996,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_017","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"{\n\"Amount\" : \"1000000\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 1 ,\n\"LedgerEntryType\" : \"NFTokenOffer\" ,\n\"NFTokenID\" : \"00081B5825A08C22787716FA031B432EBBC1B101BB54875F0002D2A400000000\" ,\n\"NFTokenOfferNode\" : \"0\" ,\n\"Owner\" : \"rhRxL3MNvuKEjWjL7TBbZSDacb8PmzAd7m\" ,\n\"OwnerNode\" : \"17\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnID\" : \"BFA9BE27383FA315651E26FDE1FA30815C5A5D0544EE10EC33D3E92532993769\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnLgrSeq\" : 75443565 ,\n\"index\" : \"AEBABA4FAC212BF28E0F9A9C3788A47B085557EC5D1429E7A8266FB859C863B3\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":3029,"char_end":3483,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_018","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Name JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 146","char_start":3508,"char_end":3558,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_019","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Amount Currency Amount Amount Yes Amount expected or offered for the NFT. If the token has the lsfOnlyXRP flag set, the amount must be specified in XRP. Sell offers that specify assets other than XRP must specify a non-zero amount. Sell offers that specify XRP can be &#x27;free&#x27; (that is, the Amount field can be equal to \"0\" ).","location_hint":"paragraph 147","char_start":3562,"char_end":3896,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_020","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Destination String - Address AccountID No The account for which this offer is intended. If present, only that account can accept the offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":3898,"char_end":4037,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_021","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Expiration Number UInt32 No The time after which the offer is no longer active. The value is the number of seconds since the Ripple Epoch.","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":4039,"char_end":4177,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_022","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"NFTokenID String - Hexadecimal UInt256 Yes The NFTokenID of the NFT referenced by this offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":4179,"char_end":4272,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_023","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"NFTokenOfferNode String - Hexadecimal UInt64 No Internal bookkeeping, indicating the page inside the token buy or sell offer directory, as appropriate, where this token is being tracked. This field allows the efficient deletion of offers.","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":4274,"char_end":4512,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_024","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Owner String - Address AccountID Yes The account that created and owns this offer. Only the current owner of an NFT can create an offer to sell an NFToken, but offers from past owners can remain in the ledger after the NFT has been transferred. Any account can create an offer to buy an NFT.","location_hint":"paragraph 152","char_start":4514,"char_end":4805,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_025","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"OwnerNode String - Hexadecimal UInt64 No Internal bookkeeping, indicating the page inside the owner directory where this token is being tracked. This field allows the efficient deletion of offers.","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":4807,"char_end":5003,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_026","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"PreviousTxnID String - Hash UInt256 Yes Identifying hash of the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":5005,"char_end":5121,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_027","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"PreviousTxnLgrSeq Number UInt32 Yes Index of the ledger that contains the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 155","char_start":5123,"char_end":5249,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_028","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"NFTokenOffer entries can have the following flags combined in the Flags field:","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":5273,"char_end":5351,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_029","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 158","char_start":5355,"char_end":5400,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_030","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"lsfSellNFToken 0x00000001 1 If enabled, the offer is a sell offer. Otherwise, the offer is a buy offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 159","char_start":5404,"char_end":5507,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_031","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Unlike Offers for fungible tokens , a NFTokenOffer is not stored in an order book and is never automatically matched or executed. A buyer must explicitly choose to accept an NFTokenOffer that offers to sell a NFToken . Similarly, a seller must explicitly choose to accept a specific NFTokenOffer that offers to buy a NFToken object that they own.","location_hint":"paragraph 161","char_start":5538,"char_end":5884,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_032","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"The transactions for NFToken trading are:","location_hint":"paragraph 162","char_start":5886,"char_end":5927,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_033","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"Each unique NFT has up to two directories : one contains offers to buy the token and the other contains offers to sell the token. (These two directories are created as necessary and deleted if empty.) Marketplaces or other client applications can use these directories to find and display offers to trade NFToken objects to users or even automatically match them and accept them.","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":6024,"char_end":6403,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_034","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"NFTokenOffer entries each count as one item towards the owner reserve of the account placing the offer, as long as the entry is in the ledger. Accepting or canceling the offer frees up the reserve.","location_hint":"paragraph 169","char_start":6427,"char_end":6624,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_035","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"The unique ID ( NFTokenOfferID ) of a NFTokenOffer object is the result of the following values concatenated in order:","location_hint":"paragraph 171","char_start":6650,"char_end":6768,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_036","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"The NFTokenOffer space key, 0x0037 ;","location_hint":"paragraph 172","char_start":6772,"char_end":6808,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_037","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"The AccountID of the account placing the offer; and","location_hint":"paragraph 173","char_start":6810,"char_end":6861,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_038","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"The Sequence (or Ticket ) of the NFTokenCreateOffer transaction that created the NFTokenOffer .","location_hint":"paragraph 174","char_start":6863,"char_end":6958,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_48fddb8ee3b6_039","source_id":"src_48fddb8ee3b6","source_hash":"8a77aa2a0ebc2d2f8b37ca3403a54f46027725c64f8c87c09cbcaabd977df6a0","text":"NFTokenAcceptOffer transaction","location_hint":"paragraph 177","char_start":6989,"char_end":7019,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:44.394Z"}
